103 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 221 0 R
/E (BRISP conducted a survey \(N=80\) and focus group \(N=6\) to learn more about the data collection and management challenges faced by research professionals in academic or university settings and medical centers. As part of the data collection, respondents recommended specific resources and described how they were used. Our findings indicate that there is a need for a range of resources, from in-depth training options to quick reference sources. Therefore, this collection looks to support multiple audiences, from the newly initiated to the expert. )
/Pg 7 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
