/P 225 0 R
/E (Your organization/institution may have collaboration tools that can be leveraged to share data, code, and resources within your teams or with your external collaborators. GitHub, Dropbox/Box, Slack, Microsoft Teams or Google Suite can often be leveraged using your organization/institution credentials. Be mindful, however, about the sensitivity of your data, and ensure that the use of these tools is appropriate based on the security protocols.)
/Pg 7 0 R
/K [15]
>>
endobj
